        "original_id": "33590970-a76e-5e52-bc33-595af192df50",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sathish Kalathil, Jacques Feyder\n- Works: Jalachhayam, Veena Vaadanam\n- Topics: Malayalam cinema, experimental filmmaking, documentary film\n\nFacts:\n- Jacques Feyder was born on 21 July 1885 and died on 24 May 1948.\n- Jacques Feyder was a Belgian actor, screenwriter, and film director who worked principally in France and also worked in the USA, Britain, and Germany.\n- Jalachhayam debuted in 2010 as Sathish Kalathil's first movie.\n- Sathish Kalathil became known for experimental works that were discussed in the Malayalam cinema industry.\n- Jalachhayam was discussed for its experimental approach.\n- Veena Vaadanam, also titled Recital of Music, is an Indian documentary film in the Malayalam language directed by Sathish Kalathil.",
